            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "christiet09"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used it this weekend for a party and it is fantastic! Did nonfat plain yogurt and reduced fat olive oil mayo with the Hidden Valley Harvest Dill dip mix. No one even knew the difference from the regular fattening dip!",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-15T10:35:05.777Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
